class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-303103 qbl.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a9/Spine_static-303103_qbl.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"551\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"295\" data-file-height=\"551\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3031\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%93%85%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83\" title=\"铅玻璃\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%93%85%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83\" title=\"铅玻璃\"><img alt=\"铅玻璃\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-303101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-303101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%93%85%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83\" title=\"铅玻璃\">铅玻璃</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>怪诞不眠夜</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303103</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">很久以前，当时间仅作为概念存在，当月亮一如既往升上夜空的时候，女孩遇见了作家。被执念所困的作家虽然已死，却从未安眠。<br /><br />女孩的身体十分虚弱，她渴望自由，渴望看看外面的世界，得知对方的身份之后，她问出了一个又一个难解的问题。<br /><br />作家的故事会被大家遗忘吗？这些意象仍会被众人铭记吗？故事一旦结束，书中人是否就是永生？<br /><br />作家顷刻做出了“完美”的答复，但完美并非合适，女孩请求作家为她讲一个故事。<br /><br />他答应了女孩的请求，为她讲述了一个又一个故事——女孩抬起纯净如玻璃的眼睛，静静聆听、仔细思考，在这些故事里重获“新生”。而在作家眼中，她的身影也逐渐与自己笔下的某个意象重叠在了一起……<br /></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/74/Belonging-303104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">苔绸宽檐女士软帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Mosst Wide-brimmed Hat</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>来自瑞典老牌工坊“LINNR<br />A”的经典维多利亚式软帽，一年仅生产十顶。<br />帽冠正面点缀着精巧的手工蕾丝，帽身则被苔绸包裹，其哑光质地能吸收一切刺激性光线，以保护这个虚弱的姑娘。<br />“我看见黑猫、乌鸦、一轮血红色的月亮。这是梦吗？真想和它们一块儿跳支舞。”<br />笔者观察到，谈及此事时，受访者的眼睛如彩绘玻璃般闪闪发光。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/64/Belonging-303105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“笼外鸟”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Bird Uncaged\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“我在这儿停留了太久，久到失去了时间的概念。持续的疼痛限制了我的行动，直到主治医师改良了它，”轻抚与她形影不离的医疗仪器，受访者向笔者娓娓道来，“于是每个月定期几天，我也能像笼外的鸟儿，飞出这儿，飞出这扇囚禁我已久的小小窗框啦！”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e8/Belonging-303106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“永生花”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Preserved Flowers</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />15<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>它曾像受访者一样脆弱，花瓣蜷曲，色泽黯淡，甚至无法承受一次轻轻的触碰。<br />而后，经由恰到好处的脱水与干燥，它被永久定格至枯萎前的瞬间。<br />“这是母亲送给我的礼物，”受访者回忆道，“她告诉我‘总有一天，你也能健康地走入风中’。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 玻璃窗前的梦1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A61.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 玻璃窗前的梦2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%AA%97%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A62.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">玻璃窗前的梦 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Dream in Stained Glass</small></span></span>"}}